    title: "API Integration Services & API Development",
    shortTitle: 'API Integration',
    description: "API integration services and custom API development: connect your CRM, ERP, payments, accounting, WhatsApp and other tools so data flows without manual work.",
    longDescription: "DEVSYNX builds and integrates APIs for businesses whose tools do not talk to each other. We connect CRMs, ERPs, payment gateways, accounting software, e-commerce platforms, couriers, WhatsApp and AI services, and we design secure REST and GraphQL APIs for your own web and mobile apps. Every integration includes error handling, retries, logging and documentation, so it keeps working when one of the connected systems has a bad day.",
